lemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20110628234029&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Slug_Drug_05a600.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a slug drug.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">A hermit near Carlin might be able to tell you more about it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Used to tame a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tiger%20Slug\"><img alt=\"Tiger Slug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiger_Slug_54dd58.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Slug\">Slug</a>. It has a chance of breaking (around 30%) when used. You can find <a href=\"#/wiki/Slug\">Slugs</a> north west in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll%20Cave\">Swamp Troll Cave</a> down a hole.<br/><br/>\n<b>Failed</b>:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The slug flees.</span><br/>\n</p><p><b>Failed</b>: <br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The slug slips through your grasp.</span><br/>\n</p><p><b>Broke</b>: <br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">This slug drug didn't seem to have any effect.</span><br/>\n</p><p><b>Succeeded</b>: <br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You drugged the slug.</span><br/>\n</p><p>It can be gotten from <a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased\">Belongings of a Deceased</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord\">Bane Lord</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord\">Bane Lord</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased\">Belongings of a Deceased</a></li><li>Bosses</li><li>Contest Prizes</li><li>Event Creatures</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Slug\">Slug</a></li><li>Slugging Around</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/swamp-fever-world-change\">Swamp Fever World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tiger%20Slug\">Tiger Slug</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["swamp-fever-world-change"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"swamp-fever-world-change","quest":"Swamp Fever World Change","step":"1-4","n":7,"title":"Abrir os pertences","kind":"reward","coords":[]}],"drops":[{"